--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party code

models/sli2vol_original.py adapts the slice-to-slice correspondence network
(ResNet-18 feature extractor, correlation layer, affinity reconstruction) of
Sli2Vol by Pak-Hei Yeung et al., MICCAI 2021
(https://arxiv.org/abs/2105.12722, https://pakheiyeung.github.io/Sli2Vol_wp/).
Credit for that architecture belongs to its authors.
